// text_list_len — length of a TextList.
//
// RENAMED from `list_len` (AXREG_VALUELIST_VOCABULARY_V1). The name is now
// held by the ValueList-typed length below. Two list types differing only in
// element type must not share one name: a caller reaching for "the length fn"
// would resolve successfully and then fail to verify, which is the worst
// failure shape — a real name with the wrong contract.
//
// The identity is UNCHANGED. Identities are authored, never minted at load,
// so renaming does not re-mint. Note this breaks the §5b convention that a
// bootstrap identity is SHA-256 of the fn name: this one remains
// SHA-256("list_len"). The convention is a minting rule, not an invariant the
// loader checks, and changing the identity would be the far worse hazard.
fn text_list_len
  identity 0x34e8951dbc64971f10e48ecae8f991090c549239477ae76ea2ae09b70a36b548
  kind     leaf
  deterministic true
  idempotent    true
  in (TextList)
  out Int
  effect pure
end

