// ── IR bundle I/O (ir_constructors.rs) ────────────────────────────────────────
//
// M1_IR_REFLECTION_REMOVAL_V1: the term-level IR reflection API — ir_make_*,
// ir_get_*, ir_term_kind, ir_to_string/ir_to_h1_string, ir_subst/ir_rename/
// ir_free_vars, ir_build_*_from_spec, ir_eval/ir_apply — was removed here.
// 29 fns, zero .m1 call sites in any repo, zero identity aliases. It was also
// incoherent: ir_make_call built Call terms and ir_get_kind reported them,
// but no accessor could read a Call's target or args back out, so a Call
// could be constructed and never destructured. ir_eval compounded it —
// a universal interpreter declared `effect fullIo`, a flat bit that both
// over-reports (every caller inherits it) and under-reports (an
// irreversible evaluated term never trips the determinacy gate).
//
// What remains is the bundle I/O trio, which has 12 live call sites in
// axAGI-code-gen-working and M1-lang-test.
