// copy drops the storage goes. Another thread finds nothing and refuses by name; spawn / channel_send / bchan_send refuse a
// handle. Keys are compared for exact equality. hmap_get returns "Ok:" + value, or "Unknown" (no sentinel). hmap_freeze moves
// the map out into a FROZEN map: immutable, readable from any thread (hmap_has / hmap_get accept it), the handle is dead after.
// hmap_hash is the only thing that hashes a frozen map (for use as a key); it is pure. The rest are fullIo + deterministic
